  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">REN21 &#x2013; Strategic intelligence to build renewable energy leadership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project develops strategic information and provides knowledge that enables actors in the field of renewable energies to work together strategically. The further development of the Mapping Tool serves this purpose. The Mapping Tool reviews published documents and visualises the connections between authors, organisations and thematic fields. This makes current trends and developments within the network visible. Furthermore, it promotes the exchange on renewable energies with relevant decision-makers. The project enables the renewable energy community to expand by identifying and reaching out to individuals and organisations that can strategically support the use of renewable energy.  It provides a space for the community to come together and develop joint activities to strengthen renewable energy leadership.</narrative>
  </description>
